  "instructions": [
    "Press and dice the tofu before marinating.",
    "In a large pot, heat olive oil over medium heat and sauté onion, garlic, and paprika until fragrant.",
    "Add diced bell pepper, tomatoes, and sauerkraut, stirring to combine.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and bring the mixture to a simmer.",
    "Add the marinated tofu and caraway seeds, cooking for 15 minutes until flavors meld.",
    "Stir in the lime juice, adjusting seasoning with salt and pepper as needed.",
    "Remove from heat and swirl in vegan sour cream for added creaminess.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
